	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Gratissimae fuerunt mihi literę tuę<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Oben <ref target="file11193">Nr. 1150</ref>.</note> vel ob hoc, ne perpetuo sit querendum, dum quis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>me rogat de vobis, nullum e <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinis</placeName> vel salutem adscribere mihi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Dolet <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>cordi meo, quod incommodum est ferendum, unde nihil unquam utilitatis <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>abstuli.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Dominus adsit nobis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p8011">adulescente</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p8011">Rudolf Gwalther</persName>; vgl. ebd., Z. 16-23.</note> non est, ut quid denegem, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>sed nescio, quam tutum sit hac tempestate esse <placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName>, praesertim illi aetati; <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>pestis enim se prodere incipit, cuius causa mallem etiam eis carere, quos <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>mecum habeo.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Aufugiunt nobiles quidam et alii ex studiosis; vix iucundum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>erit eis, qui foris sunt, nos adire.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Caeterum, quod visum fuerit, facito; <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>per me licebit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Cum <persName ref="p1365">Grynęo</persName> nihil hac de re contuli.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Alterum ex <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>libellis<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Um welche Schriften es sich handelte, ist nicht bekannt (vgl. auch oben <ref target="file11188">Nr. 1145</ref>, 74f).</note>, quos tabellio<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Sicherlich <persName ref="p4195">Niklaus Appenzeller</persName>, der auch die Antwort <persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> aus <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberg</placeName> überbrachte. <persName ref="p257">Stadtschreiber Beyel</persName> nennt seinen Namen in einem Brief vom 24. Juli (Zürich SIA. E I 1. 3a).</note> tulit ex <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberga</placeName>, precario acceperam, usque dum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>legissem ad finem.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Placuit adeo mihi, ut vertendum dederim in ling<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>uam Latinam, quo libentius hic imprimerent, ut sic multis innotes<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ceret et prodesset.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Interrumpit versionem tabellio et tam inciviliter <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>libellum repetit, ut reddiderim, postquam precatus eram, ut acciperet <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ipse tuum<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">d. h. das für <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> bestimmte Exemplar.</note> et <placeName ref="l473">Sangallum</placeName> mitteret; me enim, quem hic haberem, ad <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>te propediem daturum non sine foenore.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Verum iis verbis utebatur, ut <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>carere illo videretur melius.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Crassus homo et ineptus non <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>cupit a me ferre, quod pater eius<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Wahrscheinlich <persName ref="p6240">Ulrich Appenzeller</persName>, auch er ein Bote im Dienste <placeName ref="l587">Zürichs</placeName>.</note> tulit.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Hęc queror apud <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>te, nil aliud.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Mirum vero, quod nihil scribis de responsione <persName ref="p1974">Lutheri</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> Schreiben an die reformierten Städte der <placeName ref="l862">Eidgenossenschaft</placeName> vom 27. Juni (s. oben <ref target="file11194">Nr. 1151</ref>, Anm. 2) war am 23. Juli in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> eingetroffen; s. <hi>Bizer,</hi> Abendmahlsstreit 223.</note>; <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>fieri potest enim, ut a senatu non veniat ad nos, usque dum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>petiverimus.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Hoc quando fiat, nescio; non sumus enim petaces, praesertim, cum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ultro deberet fieri, quod petendo accipitur.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Maluissem igitur iudicium tu<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>um<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">tuum <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> de illius responsione quam hic totam epistolam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">De iudicando libro tuo<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">"De scripturae sanctae authoritate" (<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 111): vgl. oben <ref target="file11193">Nr. 1150</ref>, 12-15.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>frustra mones.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Qui iudicarem alios, qui vix meipsum intelligo?</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Placet mihi et gratus est, et gaudeo inter meos libros istum repe<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>riri.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Pax inter cęsarem et Gallum confecta per papam<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Die Vermittlung Papst <persName ref="p19981">Pauls III.</persName> zwischen Kaiser <persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName> und König <persName ref="p20225">Franz I.</persName> von <placeName ref="l832">Frankreich</placeName> hatte am 18. Juni in <placeName ref="l1221">Nizza</placeName> zu einem Waffenstillstand auf zehn Jahre geführt; s. <hi>Brandi</hi> I 333f. II 268f.</note> quid, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>putas, est adlatura?</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Liberum concilium papa ferre non potest; <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>caesar huic devotus est, etsi dicatur omni diligentia huc incumbere, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ut concilium transferatur in <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName><pb type="edition" next="181"/><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Eine solche Absicht lag dem <persName ref="p18538">Kaiser</persName> in Wirklichkeit fern (vgl. <bibl source="b9">HBBW VII</bibl> <ref target="file10976">[Nr. 934]</ref>, S. 32, Anm. 6).</note>.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Aiunt nominasse <placeName ref="l257">Constantiam</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName> et <placeName ref="l167">Genevam</placeName>; nescio vero, quid papa.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Concordiam <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>veram animorum si dederit dominus, non est, ut quis sit timendus <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>nobis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum tuis.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note> et <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName> bene valere per<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>cupio.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName>, 29. iulii anno 38.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/><persName ref="p8418">Os. Myconius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>antistiti <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>dignissimo, domino et fratri in <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Christo suspiciendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
